│ {"study_index": 408, "title": "Anaesthesia for day case excisional breast biopsy: propofol‐remifentanil compared     │
│ with sevoflurane‐nitrous oxide", "abstract": "BACKGROUND AND OBJECTIVE A randomized and prospective study was        │
│ performed to compare anaesthetic characteristics and stress hormone responses of two anaesthetic techniques. METHODS │
