│ 417, "title": "Awareness during anaesthesia: a prospective case study", "abstract": "BackgroundPatients who are      │
│ given general anaesthesia are not guaranteed to remain unconscious during surgery. Knowledge about the effectiveness │
│ of current protective measures is scarce, as is our understanding of patients\' responses to this complication. We   │
